      "value": "@{5c724f586a9e8a2255b7fc07|full_name}: \n> A great free game without microtransactions: *exists*\n\nAnd then dies because game can't be just completely free forever, and will either start selling your data and add some premium paid stuff.\nVrchat only is alive thanks to investors, but investors aren't people that just throw money at some game because they like it, they how to later take some of its profit after it will start making some.\n\nSo they will either add something to make money or you will have great free and dead game ;)\n\nAnd virtual currency can be for us, now to buy a model you need to visit some weird non-english websites like booth in future you will just buy it inside vrchat, and maybe even customize it inside the game, and just part of the money will go to vrchat and rest to the person selling that avatar.\nProfit for both sides.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
