      "value": "@{5c724f586a9e8a2255b7fc07|full_name}: > Instead, most models are shared for free\nAnd most of them illegally because authors of original ones did not agree for usage in vrchat. Quality is also often on completely different level.\n\nAnd what is wrong on buying these models inside vrchat? more people would get access to this, as not everyone know where to look for this or how to later upload it to the game, and they probably don't visit this site at all too. Such shop should still allow to share stuff for free, just easier.",
