      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On a real note tho, they r working on a virtual currency system. They talked about a virtual currency system in a dev update video and if you look at the careers they are hiring a person to implement and maintain that system. Now what that system would be like...... no one actually knows. It could be a simple system like virtual marketplace (you pay 15vrcoins or 15$ for a model and u can download that file.",
